msgid ""
"After going through this tutorial, users should understand:\n"
"- What propagated noise absorption (PNA) is, and how it mitigates two-qubit gate noise by absorbing learned inverse noise channels into the measured observable\n"
"- How to use [`samplomatic`](/guides/directed-execution-model#samplomatic) to box and annotate circuit layers for twirling, basis changes, and noise injection\n"
"- How to learn layer noise with `[NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/directed-execution-model#noiselearnerv3) and propagate it into a noise-mitigating observable with [`qiskit-addon-pna`](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna)\n"
"- How to sample randomized circuits with the `QuantumProgram` and [`Executor`](/guides/get-started-with-executor) classes in `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, and combine PNA with TREX and post-selection\n"
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver seguito questo tutorial, gli utenti dovrebbero comprendere:\n"
"- Cos'è la propagated noise absorption (PNA) e come mitiga il rumore dei gate a due qubit assorbendo i canali di rumore inverso appresi nell'osservabile misurato\n"
"- Come usare [`samplomatic`](/guides/directed-execution-model#samplomatic) per racchiudere e annotare i layer del circuito per twirling, cambi di base e iniezione di rumore\n"
"- Come apprendere il rumore dei layer con `[NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/directed-execution-model#noiselearnerv3) e propagarlo in un osservabile che mitiga il rumore con [`qiskit-addon-pna`](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna)\n"
"- Come campionare circuiti randomizzati con le classi `QuantumProgram` e [`Executor`](/guides/get-started-with-executor) in `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, e combinare PNA con TREX e post-selection\n"

